     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height:normal;margin:0cm 0cm 8pt;font-size:11pt;font-family:Calibri,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:Arial,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial\">Hello Phil,</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"line-height:normal;margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt 36pt;font-size:11pt;font-family:Calibri,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:Arial,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\">1.<span style=\"font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-size-adjust:none;font-kerning:auto;font-feature-settings:normal;font-stretch:normal;font-size:7pt;line-height:normal;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">    \r\n</span></span><span dir=\"LTR\"></span><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:Arial,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial\">In a bifactor model, can an item load on two specific\r\nfactors? </span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"line-height:normal;margin:0cm 0cm 8pt 36pt;font-size:11pt;font-family:Calibri,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:Arial,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\">2.<span style=\"font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-size-adjust:none;font-kerning:auto;font-feature-settings:normal;font-stretch:normal;font-size:7pt;line-height:normal;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">    \r\n</span></span><span dir=\"LTR\"></span><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:Arial,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial\">I tried to assign items to specific factors using the three\r\nmethods below. Only the third one worked. Can you please advise? I need to\r\nspecify them with item labels.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height:normal;margin:0cm 0cm 8pt;font-size:11pt;font-family:Calibri,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:Arial,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial\">Best</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height:normal;margin:0cm 0cm 8pt;font-size:11pt;font-family:Calibri,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:Arial,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial\">Afshin</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:Arial,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;color:rgb(80,0,80);background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial\"> </span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:Arial,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;color:rgb(80,0,80);background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial\">specific&lt;-&quot;S1=1,2,3,4</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:Arial,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;color:rgb(80,0,80);background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial\">+ S2=5,6,7,8</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:Arial,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;color:rgb(80,0,80);background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial\">+ S3=9,10,11,12&quot;</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"line-height:normal;background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:Arial,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\">BF1&lt;- bfactor(data, specific)</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:Arial,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;color:red;background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial\">Error: model must be a numeric vector</span><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:Arial,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;color:rgb(80,0,80);background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial\"></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:Arial,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;color:red;background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial\">------------------------------------------------</span><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:Arial,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;color:rgb(80,0,80);background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial\"></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:Arial,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;color:rgb(80,0,80);background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial\">specific&lt;-&quot;S1=E11M01M, E11M02C,\r\nE11M03C, E11M04C</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:Arial,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;color:rgb(80,0,80);background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial\">+ S2= E11M05M, E11M06M, E11M07M, E11M08C</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:Arial,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;color:rgb(80,0,80);background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial\">+ S3= E11M09C, E11M10M, E11M11C, E11M12M&quot;</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"line-height:normal;background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:Arial,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\"> BF1&lt;- bfactor(data, specific)</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:Arial,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;color:red;background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial\">Error: model must be a numeric vector</span><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:Arial,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;color:rgb(80,0,80);background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial\"></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:Arial,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;color:rgb(80,0,80);background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial\">---------------------------------------------------------</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"line-height:normal;background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-rep